Actor Count: integer between 2 and 20
Budget Amount: float between 1000.0 and 50000.0
Play Genre: Comedy, Drama, Musical, Tragedy
Set Complexity: integer between 1 and 10
Ticket Price: float between 5.0 and 100.0
Performance Quality: Excellent, Good, Average, Poor
Royalty Percentage: integer between 5 and 20
Costume Count: integer between 5 and 50
Promotion Spend: float between 100.0 and 10000.0
Rehearsal Hours: integer between 10 and 100
